<section class="section bg-primary py-16 text-center"><div class="container-wide mx-auto px-4"><h2 class="text-white text-3xl mb-4">Ready to Source HGH?</h2><p class="text-gray-300 max-w-xl mx-auto mb-8">Three kit configurations. Tiered pricing up to 70%. Full analytical QC: MS + SDS-PAGE + HPLC with every bulk order.</p><div class="flex justify-center gap-4 flex-wrap"><a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary text-lg group">Request a Quote <svg class="w-4 h-4 inline transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"/></svg></a></div></div></section>

